# ⚠️ Meshy animation GLBs — 8.4 MB EACH because every clip embeds the full mesh AND texture,
# not just the animation tracks. One character with 10 clips is 84 MB; a 20-creature roster
# would be 1.6 GB. Regenerable from tools/meshy_animate.py, so they stay out of git until the
# shared-mesh extraction below is solved.
monster-tamer/assets/models/anim/
